        "        let source = \"::::{req} ready\\nReady.\\n\\n:::{example} something.foo\\nGiven ready, it succeeds. CITE`requirements.ready`\\n:::\\n::::\\n\\n:::{example} bad name\\nInvalid.\\n:::\\n\\n```text\\n:::{example} hidden\\nLiteral.\\n:::\\n```\"",
